v1.43.4
Reviewers: Peter Robinson, Ben Liu

Mergeback of MR !476


Handles the case where a suffix block is to be added but the MR description doesn't exist yet.  

If it does not exist and a suffix block is to be added, then grape will initialize the description with the suffix block(s).
